+    // program for one set of constants is 32 to 768 instruction words, not 38 560 (all 43 sets the window server
+    // asked for on the phone). A scratch access at a computed offset leaves it as it was. A few rounds of the clean-up
+    // after it (nir_copy_prop's own answer does not count, as above; 32 rounds at most).
+    if (t.nir->scratch_size != 0 && scratchOffsetsConstant(t.nir) && nir_lower_scratch_to_var(t.nir)) {
